1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The most dangerous person in the room is not the one shouting.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
It's the one who completely detached their emotions.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000
When someone tries to provoke you, they are fishing for a reaction.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
If you get angry, they win.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
You give them control over your mind.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
But when you respond with absolute, cold indifference, you flip the script.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Your lack of emotion makes them realize they have zero power over

8
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,000
you.

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,000
It drives them insane trying to figure you out.

10
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Stop letting people access your peace.

11
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Control your emotions, or someone else will use them against you.

